    "created_at": "2017-05-08T23:05:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-08T23:05:47Z",
    "body": "As I've noted several times, the phrasing of \"run the following steps in parallel\" is extremely confusing to me (and at least a few other people who've agreed with me in #whatwg in the past).  It's ambiguous whether it means \"the following steps form a sub-algorithm, which should be run in parallel with the current algorithm\" or \"each of the following steps, separately, should be run in parallel with each other\".  I always read it as the latter at first. We should be using a less ambiguous wording.",
